      </section>

      <section class="ubc-ws-section">
        <div class="ubc-ws-grid ubc-ws-grid--2">
          <div class="ubc-ws-card">
            <h3>How It Works</h3>
            <ul class="ubc-ws-list">
              <li>Quick Application — instant decisions for most applicants</li>
              <li>Use Card Instantly once approved</li>
              <li>Pay Over Time with convenient monthly terms</li>
              <li>No Annual Fee &amp; $0 fraud liability (Synchrony)</li>
